From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Brue <ryanbrue.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 07:04:49 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] PROTOTYPE pvr: don't advertise VK_EXT_image_2d_view_of_3d by
 default

Local experiment for amazon-suez, never to be sent (Imagination declines
LLM-generated code in src/imagination).

zink enables image2DViewOf3D/sampler2DViewOf3D when they are offered, and
pco then lowers every 2D texture sample to a 3D sample with the slice from
the texture meta and a per-pixel LOD (pco_nir_tex.c), in every shader. On
GX6250 a full-screen wlroots textured layer (gles-layers, 1200x1920)
costs 18.0 ms that way and 9.9 ms with the features off (same build,
SUEZ_PVR_2D_VIEW_OF_3D=1 as the control). SUEZ_PVR_2D_VIEW_OF_3D=1
advertises them again.

Generated-by: LLM
---
 src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
index f5b138f4667..f025ac22bd1 100644
--- a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
+++ b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_physical_device.c
@@ -242,6 +242,10 @@ static void pvr_physical_device_get_supported_extensions(
 #endif
       .IMG_filter_linear_2d = true,
    };
+
+   /* PROTOTYPE: see pvr_physical_device_get_supported_features(). */
+   if (!getenv("SUEZ_PVR_2D_VIEW_OF_3D"))
+      extensions->EXT_image_2d_view_of_3d = false;
 }
 
 static void pvr_physical_device_get_supported_features(
@@ -593,6 +597,17 @@ static void pvr_physical_device_get_supported_features(
       /* VK_KHR_internally_synchronized_queues */
       .internallySynchronizedQueues = true,
    };
+
+   /* PROTOTYPE: with image2DViewOf3D enabled, pco compiles every 2D sample
+    * as a 3D one (slice from the texture meta, per-pixel LOD): a wlroots
+    * textured layer through zink costs 18.0 ms instead of 9.9 ms on GX6250.
+    * zink copes without the extension. Set
+    * SUEZ_PVR_2D_VIEW_OF_3D=1 to advertise it anyway.
+    */
+   if (!getenv("SUEZ_PVR_2D_VIEW_OF_3D")) {
+      features->image2DViewOf3D = false;
+      features->sampler2DViewOf3D = false;
+   }
 }
 
 static uint32_t get_api_version(void)
